}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lucy-assistant/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"本条内容由自动化代理发布。\n\n固定 turbine-explorer 完整源码、资源及原始依赖锁，通过 Git subtree 建立独立前端基线。部件抽出百分比更新对应控件；镜头验收关联可信输入与后续矩阵上传、绘制，逐步骤保存观测及失败现场。\n\n关联 Issue #3；Ticket `914d2ac32b5d2f130d718138164c8bab`。FE-BASE已登记LOCKED，协调最终独立交付核查已通过，等待按用户当前授权合并及实际集成。\n\n| 阶段 | 准确版本 |\n| --- | --- |\n| S | `7704387252b293bee1ec671b440164a12287ca16` |\n| 被测C | `ab07372aa223b1828a70a4ed37c2ac15b5d3ef2f` |\n| E | `a7966085071051d07cb7e80d0843a07ad9687183` |\n| K / PR head | `efb0a5c6cf5e44eb9297d39ea88201a4610bf15e` |\n| base / merge-base | `86e521184a4d5bbd42dfe93a48999fa714c233f2` |\n| 全新基线标签 | `baseline/FE-BASE-ab07372aa223` → E |\n\n固定上游commit=`efc5d2ecd12055f880a41b47215791c22d3656d4`，原tree=`03487ef57f6bc957dfc83b890de1f1e700ed2841`；真实subtree导入=`459a359afd4e2e2bdaca05acccc4b65f79b741d8`，完整62项文件。MIT/OFL/CC0及来源说明、原锁保留；唯一上游补丁为部件百分比四处output选择器，实际vendor tree=`fc5ac885bdb2bc8272ab77d74473a46e4b5da45c`。\n\nFE-BASE-A01～A05全部PASS。worker主32条、独立干净26条、协调独立26条真实命令全部退出0；原版和产品npm ci、npm test、build、build:labs通过。三次真实浏览器各完成32项操作/20次资源请求，覆盖双画布镜头、外壳、10组件与抽出归位、叶片和两套HDR，无页面/资源错误及GLB请求。三套全模型缩放回归通过无wheel负对照与实际-600/+600；冻结1e-5/0.01和120秒/1200秒保持。环境为Chrome156.0.8078.80、1920×1080、WebGL2 ANGLE/SwiftShader。\n\nWorker及协调独立Standards/Spec均通过；协调会话完整复验最终回执为Issue #3评论6607173203。E仅新增本次证据和VERIFIED登记，K仅状态及远程E核实登记，行为代码始终与被测C一致。全新基线及E已远程核实，完整tree、193项证据blob、报告与总清单一致，原M0-00基线保持；K已推送并核实为PR head。\n\n- [正式报告](https://github.com/shuyu-lin-dev/gas-turbine-lifecycle-lab/blob/a7966085071051d07cb7e80d0843a07ad9687183/evidence/FE-BASE/runs/ab07372aa223b1828a70a4ed37c2ac15b5d3ef2f/REPORT.md)\n- [完整证据总清单](https://github.com/shuyu-lin-dev/gas-turbine-lifecycle-lab/blob/a7966085071051d07cb7e80d0843a07ad9687183/evidence/FE-BASE/runs/ab07372aa223b1828a70a4ed37c2ac15b5d3ef2f/SHA256SUMS.json)，SHA256=`8a3461de61ecdf1c4bd658387e087e78cce220f775b895439f476ea81574d0ef`\n- [远程E及基线核实](https://github.com/shuyu-lin-dev/gas-turbine-lifecycle-lab/blob/efb0a5c6cf5e44eb9297d39ea88201a4610bf15e/evidence/FE-BASE/remote-E-verification.json)\n- [准确C复现说明](https://github.com/shuyu-lin-dev/gas-turbine-lifecycle-lab/blob/ab07372aa223b1828a70a4ed37c2ac15b5d3ef2f/docs/FE_BASE.md)\n\n证据包含原独立C5 FAIL、诊断red/green、历次失败和三次准确C实测，原始哈希保持。报告SHA256=`2d18f2bfe981842a3f07ca7564444442f5567bb97d6dd8799e26a956f4375aba`；协调独立记录SHA256=`64526dd2f202477658381901aa2da395299fc6e3b9d024c1b2247b6cad5b54fe`。\n\n准确C与最终head没有上报CI检查，仅记零项；既有保护保持。协调最终独立交付核查评论6607856530确认C→E→K全部新增差异、192项清单哈希、远程K及基线均通过。当前PR尚未合并至main，后续任务等待实际集成及单独派发。worker保留4173审查入口，等待按用户当前授权合并，不执行approve、merge或auto-merge。\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-03T10:13:05Z","updated_at":"2026-11-03T15:32:11Z","closed_at":"2026-11-03T15:32:11Z","merged_at":"2026-11-03T15:32:11Z","merge_commit_sha":"b8ad3150cf4480f8e205926541aeeccb072f7f80","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"shuyu-lin-dev:agent/frontend-upstream-baseline-914d2ac32b5d","ref":"agent/frontend-upstream-baseline-914d2ac32b5d","repo":{"id":1443777483,"node_id":"R_kgDOVg5Lyw","name":"gas-turbine-lifecycle-lab","full_name":"shuyu-lin-dev/gas-turbine-lifecycle-lab","owner":{"login":"shuyu-lin-dev","id":130219774,"node_id":"U_kgDOB8L-_g","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/130219774?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shuyu-lin-dev","html_url":"https://github.com/shuyu-lin-dev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shuyu-lin-dev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shuyu-lin-dev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shuyu-lin-dev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shuyu-lin-dev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shuyu-lin-dev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shuyu-lin-dev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/